{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，有用户發現Google Chrome瀏覽器中一項與Gemini相關的隱蔽設置，可能導致瀏覽器在用户點擊關閉按鈕後仍繼續運行，並佔用數百兆字節的內存。該問題即便在用户已關閉「Chrome關閉後繼續運行後台應用」選項的情況下，依然會出現。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587860.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:43:57.802041+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:28:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:17.177898+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:17.177898+00:00","content_hash":"dd853fca28e6157cfa52684fdee0ebaa878011faa0060a78992820cb41f7d4e9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}